    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1511">

                <pb facs="1218" n="1102" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1102"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/465.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The bankers’ delay has compelled the Government of Nicaragua to make certain
                    internal loans the conditions of which are improvident if not
                    unconscionable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Weitzel.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
